+
+The separate controller SDK launcher packs/verifies reviewed files, keeps upload SAS in memory, disables logging, records only sanitized exception class/status/service code, uses zero scheduling retries and closes clients. It writes/fsyncs an unknown-outcome intent immediately before scheduling and persists returned run ID before any log retrieval. Frozen resolver01/02 proposals remain intact. After ca1's observed failure, resolver03 changed only the FROM platform-option syntax; the exact amd64 digest and SDK platform stayed explicit. No general scanner-grammar claim is inferred.
