+Fresh retained local checks pass: four decoder guard tests, ten local specimen checks, four export corruption/truncation/path checks and helper compilation. Native macOS checks validate helpers only; combined compatibility relies on the actual Linux amd64 outputs above. Final matrix status now names ca3/ca4 installation/import successes, while its resolver/pre-validation bytes remain retained in `results/dependency-matrix-resolver.csv`, resolver artifacts and frozen contexts. There was no mutable-input rewrite inside a probe.
